OL,3,GNEWSAWoman raped by husband urges
OL,4,Aothers to speak out
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent which some readers might find
OL,8,Fdistressing
OL,10,FA woman who was raped by her then
OL,11,Fhusband has urged other victims of
OL,12,Fsexual assault to report the attacks.
OL,14,FThe man who raped and sexually
OL,15,Fassaulted Penny, not her real name, in
OL,16,F2022 was sentenced to 13 years in
OL,17,Fprison when the case reached court in
OL,18,FMay 2025.
