OL,5,
OL,6,FPenny, from Cornwall, said, despite
OL,7,Fbeing left "bruised and bleeding", she
OL,8,Ffeared speaking out would ruin her
OL,9,Fpartner's life: "That sounds ridiculous
OL,10,Fbut I think this is how a lot of women
OL,11,Fmay feel if they have been in long-term
OL,12,Frelationships."
